  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.10 Distance-learning",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.10 “Distance-learning” means electronic participation in continuing professional education or activity so long as the participation can be documented in accordance with Phy 406.\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.07); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
